===Etymology===
From {{uder|en|fr|vélodrome}}, from {{m|fr|vélo||bicycle}} + {{m|fr|-drome|}}, from {{uder|en|grc|δρόμος||a course, race course, road}}; {{confix|en|velo|drome}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈvɛl.ə.dɹəʊm/|a=UK}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-velodrome.wav|a=Southern England}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An indoor [[arena]], having an [[oval]] [[banked]] [[track]] for [[bicycle]] [[racing]].

